%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: NonaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  isForced: 1
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Good evening! You're new. Nona Beridze, [[census recorder]], district eleven. Eleven wonderful years in the State's service.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: My job is knowing who lives where. Since the blast, the State needs to know who's left. Isn't it exciting?
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Exciting?
      npcResponse: Of course! Everything's finally in motion. Curfews, checkpoints, [[whisper:the empty flats]]. It's all part of the plan.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: Do you know what caused the blast?
      npcResponse: The State knows. Isn't that enough? Wanting more is how it starts with people.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live alone. Shared spaces breed doubt. Thirty-one times through this checkpoint, and every time it's stricter. I love that. It means they're paying attention.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I noted your face the moment you sat down. You wear the State's uniform. That makes you sacred, officer!
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Sacred?
      npcResponse: You carry out its will! As long as you do, I'll pray for you. If you don't, {{I'll report you}}. Gladly.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: That's a little unusual.
      npcResponse: So I've been told! Usually by people whose names I've since passed along.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
